-- computability of a Π or Σ element, from its components' (the type clause is one for both)
FamTm : (fm : FamF) (a b : TyShape) → CompU a → CompU b → (Δ : CCtx) → Mean Δ (TV (s-fam fm a b)) → Type 1
FamTm f-pi a b Ea Eb Δ X = (Δ' : CCtx) (w : World Δ' Δ) (Y : Mean Δ' (AppV a b)) →
  PathM Δ' (TV (s-fam f-pi a b)) (fmapM Δ' (AppV a b) (TV (s-fam f-pi a b)) (app-f a b) Y) (wact Δ' Δ w (TV (s-fam f-pi a b)) X) →
  CSof a Ea Δ' (fmapM Δ' (AppV a b) (TV a) (app-a a b) Y) → CSof b Eb Δ' (fmapM Δ' (AppV a b) (TV b) (app-r a b) Y)
FamTm f-sig a b Ea Eb Δ X = CSof a Ea Δ (fmapM Δ (TV (s-fam f-sig a b)) (TV a) (sig-1 a b) X) × CSof b Eb Δ (fmapM Δ (TV (s-fam f-sig a b)) (TV b) (sig-2 a b) X)
